  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>需要： </strong></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Mandala's GUI - Dark mode</span></span></strong></a></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SZtKgXnvWM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1206958586455130142?style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fgammael_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/url?url=https://x.com/gammael_&style=for-the-badge&logo=X&label=@Gammael_&color=grey\" alt=\"X（原推特）链接\"></a></p>\n<p>非官方的自定义 Mandala's GUI - Dark Mode 模组兼容材质包。旨在为我常用的模组提供兼容性支持。（持续更新中）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>本材质包适用于 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Fabric</span> 和 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Forge</span> 版本。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mandalas-gui-dark-mode-mod/comments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">你可以在评论区提出模组适配请求</span></span></strong></a></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>NeoForge 版本：<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mandalas-gui-dark-mode-neo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a></span></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>兼容的模组：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>ACCESSORIES</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>AETHER</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>AETHER PROTECT YOUR MOA</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>APOTHIC ATTRIBUTES</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>ATTRIBUTES LIB</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>BACKPACKED</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>BARTERING STATION</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>BETTER END</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>BLUE SKIES</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>BOSS TITLES</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>CORPSE</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>COSMETIC ARMOR REWORKED</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>CURIOS</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>DAILY SHOP</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>EMI</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>FARMER'S DELIGHT</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>INMIS</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>INVENTORY MANAGEMENT</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>INVENTORY TWEAKS REFOXED</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>IRON FURNACES</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>MYTHIC CHARMS</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>POLYMORPH</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>SAWMILL</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>SKY GUIS</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>SOPHISTICATED CORE</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>SUPPLEMENTARIES (TRINKETS)</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>TOM'S SIMPLE STORAGE</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>TOM'S TRADING NETWORK</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>TRASH SLOT</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>TRINKETS</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">正在为你的整合包寻找自定义 GUI 材质包？请在 </span> <strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/SZtKgXnvWM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span></strong> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">上联系我，探讨我如何帮你实现创意！</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fGammael\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">如果方便的话，欢迎在 Ko-fi 上打赏支持。</a></span></p>",
